Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Microblogs|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Microblogs Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Microblogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Microblogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Microblogs Page|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Microblogs' at locator 'Portlet#H2_HEADER'

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Entry
Priority: 4
	Given Microblogs update Status
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
	When Microblogs goto Timeline Tab
	Then Microblogs view Entry
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
		|userName|Test Test|
Scenario: Delete Entry
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Microblogs update Status
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
	And Microblogs goto Timeline Tab
	And Microblogs delete Status
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
	And Microblogs goto Timeline Tab
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'There are no microblog entries.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
Scenario: Edit Entry
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Microblogs update Status
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
	And Microblogs goto Timeline Tab
	And Microblogs edit Status
		|entryContent|Microblog Entry Content|
		|entryContentEdit|Edited Microblogs Content|
	And Microblogs goto Timeline Tab
	Then Microblogs view Entry
		|entryContent|Edited Microblogs Content|
		|userName|Test Test|